# Working context.
#
# The agent instruction files are git-ignored for a reason that is not obvious: RolloutLoud
# rewrites a block inside each of them on every launch, and that block carries the live mission —
# including the engagement scope and its target list. Committing them would publish the scope of
# whatever was last worked on.
